{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49684","headline":"临江仙 一 · 阎选","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨停荷芰逗浓香，岸边蝉噪垂杨。\n物华空有旧池塘，不逢仙子，何处梦襄王。\n珍簟对欹鸳枕冷，此来尘暗凄凉。\n欲凭危槛恨偏长，藕花珠缀，犹似汗凝妆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}